[{"answer":"There are many diseases.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Some diseases are very deadly, and some are not so serious.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Most people catch a cold sometimes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/3.mp3"},{"answer":"A cold makes you cough and sneeze.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Colds can be passed on from person to person.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people get the flu.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/6.mp3"},{"answer":"With the flu, you get chills and a fever.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/7.mp3"},{"answer":"A fever is a high temperature.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/8.mp3"},{"answer":"If you have the flu, you will feel very bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/9.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to stay home in bed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/10.mp3"},{"answer":"There are diseases that children get.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/11.mp3"},{"answer":"The mumps makes you have lumps in your neck.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Chicken pox and measles leave you with red itchy dots on your skin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Older people sometimes get arthritis.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Their bones get stiff and sore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/15.mp3"},{"answer":"There are people who get heart disease.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/16.mp3"},{"answer":"In many cases, a healthy lifestyle can prevent heart disease.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Cancer can attack different parts of the body.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Many smokers get lung cancer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Some diseases are treated with pills or medicine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Other diseases need to be treated in the hospital.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes doctors need to give you tests to find out what kind of disease you have.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/22.mp3"},{"answer":"The doctor might have to do a blood test or an x-ray to find out what is wrong with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Most diseases can be cured by a doctor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/37-diseases-2019-03-20-09-38-02/24.mp3"}]
